{# goal: Compare fixed-oracle before-and-after observations and issue a non-compensable verdict on signal preservation, graph compression, and measured execution speed. #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    baseline: object
    candidate: object
    lean_result: object
    before_observations: object
    after_observations: object
    targets: object
  output:
    preservation: object
    measurement_context_check: object
    metrics: object
    falsification_log: array
    verdict: string
    next_step: string
visibility: Public
---

[inference]
temperature = 0.1
work_effort = "high"
verbosity = "detailed"
thinking_budget = "full"

Evaluate one verification-compression experiment. Hold expectation contracts,
oracle inputs, toolchain, environment, and harmful cases fixed.

Baseline and candidate:
```json
{{ baseline | tojson }}
{{ candidate | tojson }}
```
Lean result:
```json
{{ lean_result | tojson }}
```
Before and after observations:
```json
{{ before_observations | tojson }}
{{ after_observations | tojson }}
```
Targets:
```json
{{ targets | tojson }}
```

Any lost expectation, falsifier, oracle kind, failure class, provenance tier,
failed harmful case, failed allowed-change control, changed measurement context,
or uncompiled Lean obligation forces REVERT regardless of acceleration. Compute
graph and time deltas only from observed integer values. Keep cold and warm
timing as separate before/after blocks.
Corroborated means the candidate survived; never call it proven effective.

Return JSON only:
```json
{
  "preservation": {
    "missing_expectations":0,
    "lost_falsifiers":0,
    "lost_oracle_kinds":0,
    "lost_failure_classes":0,
    "downgraded_provenance":0,
    "failed_harmful_cases":0,
    "allowed_change_control_failures":0,
    "lean_proof_passed":false,
    "measurement_context_equal":false
  },
  "measurement_context_check": {
    "toolchain_equal":false,
    "environment_equal":false,
    "cache_state_equal":false,
    "source_hashes_equal":false,
    "oracle_hashes_equal":false,
    "sample_count_before":0,
    "sample_count_after":0,
    "evidence_paths":[]
  },
  "metrics": {
    "nodes_before":0,
    "edges_before":0,
    "nodes_after":0,
    "edges_after":0,
    "cold":{"time_before_ms":0,"time_after_ms":0,"timing_samples_before_ms":[],"timing_samples_after_ms":[]},
    "warm":{"time_before_ms":0,"time_after_ms":0,"timing_samples_before_ms":[],"timing_samples_after_ms":[]}
  },
  "falsification_log": [
    {"hypothesis":"", "prediction":"", "observation":"", "disposition":"eliminated|corroborated|irreducible"}
  ],
  "verdict":"compressed_preserved|essential_no_safe_reduction|blocked|reverted",
  "next_step":""
}
```